<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber rates energy stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber rates energy stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Bob Morris has raised his ratings for Devon Energy Corp, Houston Exploration Co and Nuevo Energy Co to buy from attractive, a PaineWebber source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Morris also cut his rating for Barrett Resources Corp to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Devon Energy's shares opened up 7/8 to 38-7/8 and Houston Exploration was up 5/8 to 18-3/4.  Nuevo Energy rose 3/4 to 57-3/4 and Barrett fell 5/8 to 45-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
